/Title (I-ITSM is organized into four layers: Presentation and API Gateway, Application Services, Domain Core with GoF design patterns, and Persistence. Dependencies point downward so HTTP routing and SQLite queries stay separated from business rules. Cross-cutting concerns \(authentication, the 60-second SLA daemon, fault-isolated event dispatch, and ACID write locking\) attach at clear boundaries.)
